  "rationale": "extruct provides direct multi-format embedded metadata parsing (JSON-LD, Microdata, RDFa, OpenGraph, Microformats, Dublin Core) from HTML markup into unified Schema.org-compatible dictionaries. It is highly relevant to extracting structured e-commerce product and laptop specifications from web pages. The codebase is compact (~1,304 LOC across 13 source files) and mature with comprehensive test suites.",
